Gonx's window decorator and control look, from github.com/idumych/gonx
(version 0.2, commit 876eaeb), MIT licence (LICENSE). Bundled so that the
Gonx theme works without installing Gonx: Themes builds the decorator on
the system it runs on (build-decorators.sh), and the control look ships
prebuilt.

Changed here: its corners are rounded by a composited app_server, when the
system's headers have RoundedDecorator.h.
